  "Solution": {
    "S": "Polyacrylonitrile can be prepared by addition polymerization of acrylonitrile using peroxide initiator. The monomer is acrylonitrile, which has the formula $\\mathrm{H_2C=CH-CN}$. Hence the correct option is C."
  },
